OL,5,
OL,6,CG2022FBBC London News is broadcast
OL,7,Ffrom Studio B, BBC Broadcasting House
OL,8,F(London), for the first time on a
OL,9,Fregular basis. This edition of the
OL,10,Fprogramme was presented by Victoria
OL,11,FHollins. From today, weekday 6.30pm and
OL,12,F10.30pm editions of the programme will
OL,13,Fbe broadcast from Studio B. Breakfast,
OL,14,Flunchtime and weekend bulletins will
OL,15,Fcontinue to be based in Studio D.
